0..74 Comment "// An `extern \"rust\"` block beyond the form, and a call its block does not"
75..116 Comment "// declare, each refused where it stands."
117..119 Comment "//"
120..197 Comment "// A member\'s types are the four fixed-width atoms, which cross as the values"
198..277 Comment "// the runtime holds. A wider type needs a layout to cross by, and the lowering"
278..296 Comment "// reads none yet."
297..299 Comment "//"
300..379 Comment "// The first block\'s member takes an `Integer` and is refused at that type. The"
380..456 Comment "// second block declares only `add`, so `less` performs an operation it does"
457..472 Comment "// not declare."
473..475 Comment "//"
476..556 Comment "// - see: #327 — not implemented: a member\'s type beyond the fixed-width atoms"
557..634 Comment "// - see: `model/interop/boundary/round-trip.gandr` — the form, called from"
635..644 Comment "//   Rust"
646..722 Comment "/// A member that takes an arbitrary-precision integer, which no fixed width"
723..735 Comment "/// carries."
